    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0306" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg272"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Our patrol fleet sails May 1. Sealing vessels returning with spring catch will
                    also put to sea about same time. Modus, to be effective, should be agreed upon
                    without delay. Explain situation and renew effort for answer from British
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
